1. Replaced the `@calcom/ui/components/form/select/Select` import with `react-select`
2. Used `ReactSelect` directly instead of the custom Select component
3. Added basic classNames for styling
4. Removed unnecessary generic type parameters from InputComponent
5. Kept the essential props and components configuration

This should resolve the import error and provide the necessary context for the InputComponent to work properly. The component will now have access to the required styling infrastructure through ReactSelect.

